## Design Principles

1. **Composition over Inheritance** - Spells are composed of independent components
2. **Modularity** - New generators/modifiers/payloads can be added without changing existing code
3. **Determinism** - Same input always generates same output
4. **Scalability** - System designed to support thousands of simultaneous spells
5. **Extensibility** - Architecture allows expansion for VFX, SFX and AI-powered balancing

