## Important Notes

- This project requires intermediate to advanced knowledge of Unity DOTS/ECS
- DOTS usage is not optional - it's fundamental to the architecture
- All implementation must follow established performance patterns
- The Generator/Modifier/Payload model must be strictly respected
- JSON validation is critical - never blindly trust LLM output
- Always maintain separation between data (components) and logic (systems)
- For implementation details, consult specific concept files on-demand
- For deep conceptual understanding, refer to the detailed architecture document
